  lines:
  - So, I forgot to tell you that...
  - This boat only carry 1 person at a time
  - So you know...
  - I can go on that boat alone...
  - And send in a big boat to get you to the other side...
  - I know this sounds crazy but trust me
  - But before that...
  - What's your name?
